  exerciseTitle: Walking Quest doesn't progress
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459498
  exerciseText: Walking Quest does not progress
  hintText: Is the onUpdate event being fired? Is the movement logic correct?
  solutionText: The lastPosition is wrong, it is being defined inside the event instead
    of outside, which keeps the current position instead of the last position.
